          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.613,
            0.746,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": "Did you also observe any of these microorganisms or something different? Record in your notebook and discuss in your class. In Tables 2.1 and 2.2, you have identified a variety of microorganisms. They are everywhere, and we can only see them with a microscope—a device that magnifies them 100 to 400 times. Though microorganisms are small in size, they play an important role in our lives."
        },
